    {
        "content": "<p>If <code>get!</code> is being necessary, I only see two reasons:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You have corrupted cache files</li>\n<li>Hash collisions are happening, though not necessarily because of an issue in the hashing function, but in the hashing mix involved</li>\n</ul>",
